    "subType": "classFeat",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a full-round action, a thief with this talent can use two potions, two wands, or two scrolls. Each item is expended or loses a charge as if used normally. The thief chooses to gain the magical effect of one, but calculates its effects using the caster level of the other. The thief must still succeed at a Use Magic Device check to operate scrolls or wands unless some other ability allows him to do so, but makes only one skill check to operate both items.</p>",
